@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### The open ticket queue
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?page=1&pageSize=20

### One ticket
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1

### Raise a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Cannot download my receipt",
  "description": "The receipt link returns an empty file.",
  "priority": "High",
  "requesterEmail": "someone@example.test"
}

### Resolve a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/7/resolve

### Every agent
GET {{host}}/api/agents

### One agent's open workload
GET {{host}}/api/agents/1/workload
